00-first: reading="when im tired at night, talking is faster than typing for me and opening a terminal feels like work, I can know whether the main problem is voice, starting dumps, or both, so capturing thoughts at night can feel easier." focused={"id":"model-dd2786a8d036a661","text":"Do you want to investigate whether voice, starting dumps, or both is the main problem, or are you already aiming to make night-time dumping easier regardless of the cause?"}
00-first: reading="For a human leading work across the entire agentic software development lifecycle, I can coordinate work from the brain dump through a human-review-ready PR while improving the health of the code base, so each change makes the next change easier and the system compounds its value. It works if the work has rigor, durability, cohesion, and verification that all \"just work\" while considering both the trees and the forest; remain human-first, with the human tasting the final product, and must not optimize only for individual code changes." focused={"id":"model-3bfb8ddecefdfa77","text":"What must this system never take out of the human's hands or get wrong?"}
